0..70 Comment "// Curry\'s paradox, refused at its consumer. A family whose node holds"
71..146 Comment "// a function from the family itself declares: the function\'s domain stands"
147..219 Comment "// strictly below the node, a stratified definition. What refuses is the"
220..296 Comment "// consumer applying the function to the node it was read from, which stands"
297..371 Comment "// at no stage the function takes, directly or through a helper that takes"
372..421 Comment "// the function at its declared type. Shared with"
422..461 Comment "// `../../model/data/stratified.gandr`."
462..464 Comment "//"
465..501 Comment "// - see: #517 — `bad`, `smuggled`"
